        "html": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; color: #222;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">Hi {{$json.name}},</h2>\n  <p>Thanks for reaching out to us! We received your message and wanted to confirm it's already in the hands of our team.</p>\n  <p><strong>Here's a quick summary of what you sent us:</strong></p>\n  <table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 16px 0;\">\n    <tr><td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: #666;\">Company</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 0;\">{{$json.company}}</td></tr>\n    <tr><td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: #666; vertical-align: top;\">Message</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 0;\">{{$json.message}}</td></tr>\n  </table>\n  <p>Someone from our team will follow up with you shortly, typically within one business day.</p>\n  <p>Talk soon,<br/>The Team</p>\n</div>",
